%% Source of truth for the rendered greenlight-architecture.png / .svg.
%% The rendered form is produced by scripts/build-architecture-diagram.mjs;
%% this file is the same sequence in Mermaid so the diagram can be read,
%% diffed and re-rendered without the custom renderer.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C  as Claude Code<br/>coding session
    participant G  as GitHub<br/>commit + Actions run
    participant GL as GreenLight<br/>API · worker · receipt
    participant B  as Blnk v0.15.1<br/>third-party workload
    participant S  as SigNoz<br/>self-hosted · v0.134.0

    Note over C,S: 1 — RECORD THE CHANGE
    C-->>G: AI-Traceparent git trailer<br/>optional — reads "not linked" in the recorded run
    G->>GL: commit, branch and CI run metadata<br/>GitHub REST — the run that approved this exact SHA
    GL->>S: ★ CI run reconstructed as OpenTelemetry spans<br/>GitHub Actions is not a native SigNoz source — this is the bridge

    Note over C,S: 2 — DEPLOY AND OBSERVE
    GL->>B: deploy the commit as an immutable service.version<br/>same image digest — only the configuration differs
    B->>S: OTLP request traces<br/>service.version = commit SHA · http.route = /balances
    GL->>S: OTLP traces, metrics and logs for GreenLight itself<br/>logs carry commit_sha · five custom greenlight.* instruments

    Note over C,S: 3 — MEASURE AND DECIDE
    GL->>S: Query Builder v5 — count, p90, p95, error rate<br/>one query per window, scoped to a single immutable version
    S-->>GL: 1.44 ms baseline → 10.45 ms candidate<br/>257 and 260 spans — both above the 200-span floor
    GL->>S: SigNoz MCP — the same question, agent-native<br/>streamable HTTP, with no direct-query fallback
    S-->>GL: corroborating p95 pair + three slowest traces<br/>every cited trace ID must still resolve, or the check fails
    S-->>GL: p95 alert rule fires, then resolves<br/>version-agnostic — it follows whatever is deployed now

    GL->>GL: verdict: regressed · recovery verified · evidence receipt<br/>correlation, never causation — missing evidence stays visibly missing
